# Review package: ticket 03, 5b42960..8464f3f

## Commits
### 8464f3f
docs(state): name nine mutating array methods in spec and agent docs

The main array-mutation spec purpose and requirement, the root key
behaviors and the source wrapArrayMethod row now count fill and
copyWithin.

### 17a14c5
test(state): pin loop detection and hooks for fill and copyWithin

A sync effect that only calls fill raises nothing and raises once it
also read a written index. copyWithin raises only when its source and
target ranges overlap. Child and microtask effects raise nothing.

On hooked state, onRead sees the method name and every property read,
and onWrite sees every property written and no other.


